      "writtenOn": "2025-01-24T19:31:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I felt that `lib.rs` is more for communication and actual execution logic should be kept out of it as much as possible. It made sense to pass information to BAS and allow it to determine whether or not it should be disconnecting itself. If you feel strongly otherwise, I can leave it as is.",
